OL,3,GNEWSA'Now feels right to show Banks's
OL,4,Avital history'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA photographer has paid homage to a
OL,7,Fcity's brewing history with an
OL,8,Fexhibition of behind the scenes images.
OL,10,FTegen Kimbley was in awe of the Bank's
OL,11,FBrewery "Charlie and the Chocolate
OL,12,FFactory-esque" design when she started
OL,13,Fworked at the Wolverhampton site in
OL,14,F2018.
