OL,3,GNEWSA'Now feels right to show Banks's
OL,4,Avital history'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 30-year-old began taking photos to
OL,7,Fshow the inner workings of the historic
OL,8,Flandmarks. The display can be viewed at
OL,9,Fthe Wolverhampton Arts Centre until
OL,10,FTuesday. "It feels like the right time
OL,11,Fto showcase such an important part of
OL,12,FWolverhampton's history," she told the
OL,13,FBBC.
OL,15,FProduction of Banks's moved to
OL,16,FBurton-on-Trent last year, after 150
OL,17,Fyears in the city.
